ese bounds are highly dependent on the graph class (e.g., general, trees, or regular graphs)[10][5]. Most academic literature on this topic focuses on proving that $\\gamma_R(G)$ is constrained by the \"distance\" metrics of the graph to ensure efficient domination[3][11].\n\nSources:\n[1] [emergentmind.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHO90InsyQV573iwg-MJ1CDIjCZnT1X1bAOjdauP07b88fFV5aSEwwLsbhucqGNjCsUItRkfA63PgTfT7i8pG-exZrR-CbvwLLSsF-811xnsE7iMLRNjU59bbmXW3mSzIs6qjzlDx9SF0wAotAk7EI93w==)\n[2] [dergipark.org.tr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG6JK46dnyajDjG64LxwVJkhc3uw2dgdyn0VkCVAEB_e8liOooXmn0T7RCvbVIm1NprvSiPZp_LYYbFkN-3UecbyBQR-2FSCFGKr_lNESNbjc7OJhAF8fHSNGffWwkVGNtt5fY7Bcjxo3gzRuA38Fg=)\n[3] [researchgate.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFW3Kw_MxiWPdZXFUDxk7BKVs519Ku8vfI3iw3-C0M42xgoGjONYZAvb04ojlI1nOf_g_9FtA2VXb9dzZiitbg4YaUS--S680M2FDWwj6o_Mejvumnr15UpCyBbRdlnNPY30mystwtybNzEyE87iICpSbmAy4KCVghlwPVs9TmZeGDOq4CoL-VS9E1NnA0lpcIV0v7NZg==)\n[4] [researchgate.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFW3Kw_MxiWPdZXFUDxk7BKVs519Ku8vfI3iw3-C0M42xgoGjONYZAvb04ojlI1nOf_g_9FtA2VXb9dzZiitbg4YaUS--S680M2FDWwj6o_Mejvumnr15UpCyBbRdlnNPY30mystwtybNzEyE87iICpSbmAy4KCVghlwPVs9TmZeGDOq4CoL-VS9E1NnA0lpcIV0v7NZg==)\n[5] [combinatorialpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHMSMkYuc-nLU0386lJn0YkWstLAl6cqcKlsTFTJxfDuWjf3cb7eZcFQ_4Hq9QOu_9Fz9wc5-SNicr1tWVgVrO9cqYvL2drgJ9N9bIa14FXAFFfMkqDoTUxB_b7fi7DuOAJ-wW4gg6Cuz6eTAhYR4Nad10pOwkdPvrms9lrmlezXNED57Wm67dTp38KlAf9iXpX6qPI0XgcnW3sHuao2jgTAA==)\n[6] [ejpam.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGBaIpP9J9ZbMGZq4_j4S7V6cF1HlZ7ZHzaCV5Aod5FoyKPQP2HtAIPlTLgOw4nfbJpHo-XHVX055RRfM9BKa9rHrK5jKp89mwihqpW8swzdknKFN-SUWANfwWaq-E16O7io0vmJ1-rxQ==)\n[7] [ijmsi.ir](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirec